-- Experiment 188 -- SIAM 100-Digit Challenge, App. D Problem 13 (FriCAS column).
-- A parameter search (find z0 with |u(50)| = 1) around an ODE solve.  FriCAS
-- has a fixed-step rk4 but no event location and no root finder for a general
-- real function (solve/complexSolve are polynomial only; Newton is not a
-- built-in), so both rows are SKIP.  See nonlinear_ode_z0.m.
)read ../siam100_common.input )quiet
vskip("d13.machine", "FindRoot")
vskip("d13.wp50", "FindRoot")
)quit
